Package: epub-shrink
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         python3-pil,
Description: shrink EPUB images for 1-bit e-ink readers
 Rewrites every raster image inside an EPUB as an 8-bit grayscale
 baseline JPEG, downscaled to fit the panel of XTEInk devices running
 CrossInk firmware (800x480, 1-bit with dithering), then repacks the
 archive correctly with the mimetype entry first and uncompressed.
 .
 When an image changes extension (PNG/GIF to JPEG), the OPF manifest
 entry and every src/href/url() reference in the content documents are
 rewritten to match. Works on single files, multiple files, or whole
 directory trees; by default it overwrites the originals in place.
